// enable switch  0 - off 1 - on
// output: snapshot linkage/trigger
//       (0x1 << 1)  save snapshot image to SD card
//       (0x1 << 2)  send snapshot image via email
//       (0x1 << 7)  send alarm image via FTP
// ftp_interval  FTP snapshot interval   unit: seconds
// email_interval  email snapshot interval   unit: seconds   <- Corrected key based on context
// sdcard_interval  SD card snapshot interval   unit: seconds   <- Corrected key based on context
// schedule: alarm time periods (Sunday-Saturday). Supports setting up to 3 time periods per day.
// file_mode: file storage method  0 - Overwrite mode 1 - DateTime-suffix filename
// filename: overwrite mode filename

// scheduled-snapshot-settings
// 1. (get)	GET
// 2. (set) POST
// 3. (default)	GET


// 1. (get)	GET
// ipcam-cgi-scripts:
/cgi-bin/web.cgi?mod=timing_snapshot&cmd=get

